            "review_text": "2travelerslife\nWorld77 contributions\n0\nEuropean restaurant in Nha Trang\nDec 2022 • Couples\nIt's absolutely amazing place with gorgeous interior and high service. The food is really tasty. We've tried seabas and steak which were of the very high quality. \n\nIt's calm and fashionable, i would recommend this place for breakfast, lunch and dinner. \n\nAnd even you can find there some tables for a company, have a meeting or party dinner.\n\nSince it is the center of the city, you will definitely find it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 12, 2022",
